(https://github.com/prosperity-solutions/maintenance-manager, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Prosperity Solutions), commit
bcf0985284b270fc789d5946c25c6ba76535973d, which in turn ported it from outfit
(https://github.com/prosperity-solutions/outfit, MIT License) and veld
(https://github.com/prosperity-solutions/veld, MIT License):

  - the run phases, owner runbook and ship workflow: docs/HANDOVER.md §0, §20–§23
    and .agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md (also docs/ship.md)
  - the review method: docs/agentic-review.md
  - the ship stamp: scripts/dev/prmeta.sh and scripts/ci/ship-gate.sh
  - the agent guard and its fixtures: scripts/dev/agent-guard.sh,
    scripts/dev/testdata/guard/
  - the public-ID check: scripts/dev/public-ids.sh
  - the owner's repository hardening script under scripts/dev/ (structure)
  - the `commits`, `ship` and `all-green` jobs in .github/workflows/ci.yml
  - the dependency-age gate (tools/depage, rewritten in Rust for crates.io)
  - the structure of AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .claude/agents/, lefthook.yml,
    .github/dependabot.yml and .github/fresh-deps.txt

